.Dd January 25, 2026
.Dt VGA 4
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm vga
.Nd unified video adapter driver
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Cd "video=vga"
.Cd "video=cga"
.Cd "video=ega"
.Cd "video=hercules"
.Cd "video=bga"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver provides support for various IBM PC-compatible video display adapters, including VGA, EGA, CGA, and Hercules Graphics Card (HGC). It handles mode setting, memory mapping, and basic pixel drawing operations for the kernel framebuffer console.
.Pp
The driver uses a table-driven approach to initialize the cathode ray tube controller (CRTC) registers (Motorola 6845 for CGA/Hercules, and standard VGA CRTC for others) to establish video timings.
.Sh HARDWARE SUPPORT
The following adapters and modes are supported:
.Bl -tag -width "Hercules"
.It Standard VGA
Mode 12h (640x480, 16 colors, planar access).
Mode 13h (320x200, 256 colors, linear access).
Mode 10h (640x350, 16 colors, planar access).
.It CGA
Mode 4 (320x200, 4 colors). Uses standard BIOS-compatible palette (Cyan/Magenta/White).
.It Hercules
720x348 Monochrome graphics. Configures the 6845 CRTC for high-resolution text/graphics.
.It Bochs BGA
Bochs Graphics Adapter (Linear Framebuffer). Supports high resolutions (e.g., 1024x768) if enabled via
.Cd video=bga .
.El
.Sh CONFIGURATION
The driver defaults to Standard VGA Mode 12h (640x480) if no boot argument is specified.
.Pp
Specific hardware modes can be enforced via the kernel command line:
.Bl -tag -width "video=hercules"
.It Cd video=vga
Force Standard VGA/EGA detection.
.It Cd video=cga
Initialize assuming CGA hardware (Mode 4).
.It Cd video=hercules
Initialize assuming Hercules hardware (720x348).
.It Cd video=bga
Attempt to use the Bochs Graphics Adapter extensions (virtualization).
.El
.Sh FONTS
The driver includes compiled-in 8x16 and 8x8 fonts (CP437 character set) to ensure text is rendered correctly regardless of the video bandwidth or resolution width.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "sys/drivers/video/vga.c" -compact
.It Pa sys/drivers/video/vga.c
Main driver implementation.
.It Pa sys/drivers/video/font_8x16.c
8x16 CP437 font bitmap.
.It Pa sys/drivers/video/font_8x8.c
8x8 CP437 font bitmap.
.It Pa sys/drivers/video/hercules.c
Legacy Hercules support (now integrated).
.El
